    <h2>It Started With a <span class="crayon-hl">Box of Crayons</span></h2>
    <p>At 18, Kay experienced a mental health crisis and spent three months cycling between ICU, inpatient, and outpatient psychiatric services. At one of their lowest points, a thoughtful nurse handed them a box of crayons.</p>
    <p>Their first storyboards were crayon sketches of other patients&rsquo; stories: abstract drawings depicting color, chaos, beauty, and hope. What started as crayons in the hospital evolved into over a decade of filmmaking.</p>
    <div class="qi">&ldquo;I truly don&rsquo;t think I would be here today without this <span class="crayon-hl crayon-hl-gold">box of crayons</span>.&rdquo;</div>
