<section id="homework" class="section section-light"><div class="section-inner">
  <span class="eyebrow">Your Next Step</span>
  <h2 class="section-title">Homework / <span class="crayon-hl">Call to Action</span></h2>
  <p class="section-subtitle">Take these questions with you. They&rsquo;ll be the starting point for the Learning Community sessions. Click each step to expand.</p>
  <div class="accordion">
    <div class="accordion-item"><button class="accordion-header"><span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px"><span style="flex-shrink:0;width:36px;height:36px;background:var(--brand-gold);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;font-weight:900;color:var(--brand-dark)">1</span> Clarify Your Goal</span><span class="ai-icon">+</span></button><div class="accordion-body"><div class="abi"><p>What is one mental health goal or challenge in your work where better storytelling could make a difference?</p><p style="color:var(--brand-blue);font-style:italic">Examples: buy-in from leadership, community awareness, video for a grant, policy change, increased referrals, fundraising, clinician training adoption.</p></div></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><button class="accordion-header"><span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px"><span style="flex-shrink:0;width:36px;height:36px;background:var(--brand-gold);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;font-weight:900;color:var(--brand-dark)">2</span> Clarify Your Audience &amp; Outcome</span><span class="ai-icon">+</span></button><div class="accordion-body"><div class="abi"><p>Who most needs to see, feel, or understand this message?</p><p>If this story were successful, what would change? What would people think, feel, or do differently?</p></div></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><button class="accordion-header"><span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px"><span style="flex-shrink:0;width:36px;height:36px;background:var(--brand-gold);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;font-weight:900;color:var(--brand-dark)">3</span> Consider Format &amp; Feasibility</span><span class="ai-icon">+</span></button><div class="accordion-body"><div class="abi"><p>After today&rsquo;s examples, what kind of story are you most drawn to, given your goal? Why?</p><p style="color:var(--brand-blue);font-style:italic">Documentary? Animation? Illustration? Think about what medium matches your goal, audience, and capacity.</p></div></div></div>
    <div class="accordion-item"><button class="accordion-header"><span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px"><span style="flex-shrink:0;width:36px;height:36px;background:var(--brand-gold);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:16px;font-weight:900;color:var(--brand-dark)">4</span> What Constraints Do You Need to Account For?</span><span class="ai-icon">+</span></button><div class="accordion-body"><div class="abi"><p>Time, budget, staff, technology, risk: what are the real-world factors that will shape what&rsquo;s possible?</p><p>Remember: the best film is not the most expensive film. Sometimes less is more.</p></div></div></div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top:32px;padding:28px;background:var(--brand-white);border:1px solid #e0ddd6">
    <p style="font-family:'Montserrat',sans-serif;font-size:14px;font-weight:700;color:var(--brand-text);margin-bottom:8px">Ready to go deeper?</p>
    <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--brand-muted);margin-bottom:16px">Bring your answers to the Learning Community sessions. Session 1 covers documentary, Session 2 covers animation &amp; illustration, Session 3 is an open peer exchange.</p>
